# vChewing technical-vocabulary supplemental wordlist.
#
# Format: one stem per line. Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are
# ignored. Treated as exact-match tokens (lower-cased) by EnglishWordLexicon.
#
# Add words here when you find a real-world English / tech token that the
# bundled SCOWL list does not cover, and the Trie keeps slicing it apart
# in mixed mode (e.g. `npm + j6`).
#
# Keep entries lower-case unless you specifically need a particular casing.

